1
00:09:05,454 --> 00:09:11,454
Sakima and the Masked Marvel is a action film directed by Spencer Gordon Bennet.

2
00:18:10,909 --> 00:18:16,909
Feature version of the 1943 serial "The  Masked Marvel", q.v.,
edited for television syndication and 16mm rental only.

3
00:27:16,363 --> 00:27:22,363
The Masked Marvel, played by Tom Steele.

4
00:36:21,818 --> 00:36:27,818
Alice Hamilton, played by Louise Currie.

5
00:45:27,272 --> 00:45:33,272
Mura Sakima, played by Johnny Arthur.

6
00:54:32,727 --> 00:54:38,727
Martin Crane, played by William Forrest.

7
01:03:38,181 --> 01:03:44,181
Killer Mace, played by Anthony Warde.

8
01:12:43,636 --> 01:12:49,636
Robert Barton, played by David Bacon.

9
01:21:49,090 --> 01:21:55,090
The Masked Marvel (1943) is a 12-chapter film serial created by Republic
Pictures, who produced many other well known serials.

10
01:30:54,545 --> 01:31:00,545
It was Republic's thirty-first serial, of the sixty-six they produced.
